    "description": "Title:\nNatural & Polished Crystals Mineral Specimens Clustered Stones Lot\nCondition:\nPre-owned\nCondition Description:\nPre-owned - shows typical handling wear\nCategory:\nJewelry & Watches\nGemstone Color:\nMulti-color\nGemstone Form:\nLoose\nGemstone Shape:\nMixed\nGemstone Type:\nAssorted\nDescription:\nEnhance your collection with this varied assortment of loose crystal and mineral specimens in tumbled, rough, pointed, and clustered forms. Each piece presents unique natural colors and textures, ranging from delicate purple clusters and mint green chunks to polished gray and pink stones, as well as translucent pale-yellow points and geode slices with sparkling interiors. The selection is ideal for display, hands-on study, or decorative use. These crystals are individually distinct, giving visual appeal and tactile interest for collectors, students, or hobbyists interested in geology and natural minerals. All pieces are stand-alone specimens, not designed for jewelry, electronics, or glassware use. Surfaces vary from glossy and smooth to rough and jagged, allowing for versatile arrangement. Condition is pre-owned with typical signs of handling, but no major flaws are apparent from available images. This is a versatile assortment that offers both educational and aesthetic benefits to any geological collection",
